      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "21. 加法的性质"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任何数的加法都满足交换律和结合律."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**交换律：对于任意两数 $a$ 和 $b$，下列等式成立.**",
        "$a+b=b+a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例. $(-6)+(-10)=-(6+10)=-16$；",
        "$(-10)+(-6)=-(10+6)=-16$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**结合律：对于任意数 $a,b,c$，下列等式成立.**",
        "$(a+b)+c=a+(b+c)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "应用加法定律可以任意选定运算顺序，使几个加数的加",
        "法计算变得简便."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "特别是需要把几个正数和负数相加时，可以把正数与负",
        "数分别相加，然后再把正数的和与负数的和相加."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1. $-4+(-20)+6+13+(-7)+8+(-5)$",
        "$=-36+27=-9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1) $-4+(-20)+(-7)+(-5)=-36$；",
        "2) $6+13+8=27$；",
        "3) $-36+27=-9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2. $4.72+(-5.7)+(-308.6)+19.1+(-120.12)$",
        "$+3.28=-434.42+27.1=-407.32$."
      ]
    },
